{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development","id":1460211,"title":"The Second Inquisition sourcebook is now in full development","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-17T05:53:06-07:00","id":1460211,"title":"The Second Inquisition sourcebook is now in full development","content":"<b><a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-and-book-of-nod-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/\" target=\"_blank\">Announcing the Second Inquisition Sourcebook and Book of Nod for Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition!</a></b><br /><br /> Posted by Renegade Games on Sep 15th 2021<br /> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/second-inquisition-sourcebook-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-ed/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/product_images/uploaded_images/vamprpg-2ndinq-website-banner-1140x441-preorder.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div> Greetings Vamily! Today we're updating you on the status of the Second Inquisition and Book of Nod books, and sharing some exciting news about improvements to the Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition implementation on Roll20!<br /> <br /> While you can learn about the new books below, we're happy to announce today a number of improvements to the Roll20 version of Vampire: The Masquerade! These tweaks and fixes are just the beginning of a robust roadmap of additional functionality and features that will be added for both new and existing owners.<ul><li>Dice updated to Vampire: The Masquerade Design in the dice roll template</li> <li>Character sheets show when a character is impaired, and handle superficial and aggravated damage appropriately</li> <li>Disciplines in the Core Rulebook have drag and drop functionality with the character sheet</li> </ul><br /> If you haven't checked on the module recently, we encourage you to give it another look now, and <a href=\"https://help.roll20.net/hc/en-us/articles/360045655014-Reporting-a-Bug\" target=\"_blank\">please reach out to Roll20</a> with additional requests and any bugs encountered!<br /> <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/second-inquisition-sourcebook-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-ed/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/product_images/uploaded_images/second-inq-3d-rgb-2000px.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div> <b><i>The secret Church and the hidden State, hunting the hunters in cities and across continents.</i></b><br /><br /> An antagonists\u2019 guide to the rising Second Inquisition, this book contains:<ul><li>Opponents of your Kindred, and their special forces and equipment</li> <li>Information on the fires rising against the world\u2019s vampires, stoked by the Society of St. Leopold and the American FIRSTLIGHT black program</li> <li>New tools to expand your chronicles, including eldritch Artifacts, dozens of dangerous antagonists, and the tactics your coterie can use to fight back</li> </ul><br /> <b>Release Expected:</b> January 2022<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T05:54:35-07:00","id":1460212,"title":"","content":"Am the only person who thinks that with FIRSTLIGHT being retconned to be an American-only thing that they're subtly retconning things to be more sensible? I wouldn't be surprised if the SI will no longer be international but a variety of independent things arising roughly at the same time.<br /> <br /> After all THE FALL OF LONDON was actually just Mithras' cult manipulating the Arcanum and British government.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Ct