userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T06:52:04-07:00","id":1460216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460215#post1460215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inquisition is really the Inconnu/Inner Circle/Old Vampire's conspiracy to lower the kindred pop with private agencies that have been tricked into thinking they are working with their respective Governments.<br /> <br /> /OnlyReasonableWay<br /> <br /> The art looks pretty, but hardly representative of what people think when they hear &quot;Second Inquisition&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, that is literally what happened in THE FALL OF LONDON.<br /> <br /> Ditto the fall of the Mausoleum and the death of Augustus Giovanni being the secret work of the Harbingers.<br /> <br /> We're all agreed that Vienna fell because of Tremere or some other insider too.<br /> <br /> So, you're not wrong.<br /> <br /> Congrats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T08:30:03-07:00","id":1460221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460215#post1460215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inquisition is really the Inconnu/Inner Circle/Old Vampire's conspiracy to lower the kindred pop with private agencies that have been tricked into thinking they are working with their respective Governments.<br /> <br /> /OnlyReasonableWay<br /> <br /> The art looks pretty, but hardly representative of what people think when they hear &quot;Second Inquisition&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I hope they do what they proposed when they originally announced the concept of SI: Make it a pawn of the technocracy. <br /> <br /> <br /> Or, the antediluvians and methuselah targetted by the gehenna war help the SI to convince elders to submit to the beckoning quickly. &quot;Don't resist, come, your home is already a hell in becoming with those pesky mortals.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T08:55:38-07:00","id":1460222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460221#post1460221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope they do what they proposed when they originally announced the concept of SI: Make it a pawn of the technocracy.<br /> <br /> <br /> Or, the antediluvians and methuselah targetted by the gehenna war help the SI to convince elders to submit to the beckoning quickly. &quot;Don't resist, come, your home is already a hell in becoming with those pesky mortals.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like the Technocracy dramatically takes away from what makes V:TM special and I wish they'd retcon the destruction of Ravnos to something done by the Second Inquisition.<br /> <br /> The Camarilla should control humanity, not the Technocracy, at least in their own game.<br /> <br /> Also, the Technocracy is kind of dead as an organization or at least a shadow of its former self. The drawbacks of being PCs now.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T09:18:24-07:00","id":1460224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460222#post1460222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I feel like the Technocracy dramatically takes away from what makes V:TM special and I wish they'd retcon the destruction of Ravnos to something done by the Second Inquisition.<br /> <br /> The Camarilla should control humanity, not the Technocracy, at least in their own game.<br /> <br /> Also, the Technocracy is kind of dead as an organization or at least a shadow of its former self. The drawbacks of being PCs now.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was the announced project that 5th edition would start a one world of darkness. One where each splat could interact with each others in a realistic way. <br /> <br /> Separating the union from the si take away the believability of the setting, and doesn't add to vampire.<br /> <br /> It's merely a way to avoid making the SI a mere plot devise with deus ex machina powers. Making the technocracy it's ruler isn't important as far as vampires are concerned, and it keep the desired notion that humanity is dangerous without kindred influence, technocrats being, for the majority, humans.<br /> <br /> <br /> If the SI is the pawn of vampires only, it doesn't explain their massive organisation ability and their stealth in front of camarilla's intelligence gathering.<br /> <br /> Of course Saulot, Vitel, Dracula and Enoch can be the true masterminds, but it take away the danger of humans as merely another part of the Jyhad.<br /> <br /> Although that's still better than the SI rocking vampires by themselves without sponsors","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T09:32:58-07:00","id":1460225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460224#post1460224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It was the announced project that 5th edition would start a one world of darkness. One where each splat could interact with each others in a realistic way.<br /> <br /> Separating the union from the si take away the believability of the setting, and doesn't add to vampire.<br /> <br /> It's merely a way to avoid making the SI a mere plot devise with deus ex machina powers. Making the technocracy it's ruler isn't important as far as vampires are concerned, and it keep the desired notion that humanity is dangerous without kindred influence, technocrats being, for the majority, humans.<br /> <br /> <br /> If the SI is the pawn of vampires only, it doesn't explain their massive organisation ability and their stealth in front of camarilla's intelligence gathering.<br /> <br /> Of course Saulot, Vitel, Dracula and Enoch can be the true masterminds, but it take away the danger of humans as merely another part of the Jyhad.<br /> <br /> Although that's still better than the SI rocking vampires by themselves without sponsors</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, I mean the whole point of the SI is that they're humans showing that if the human race turned its resources against the undead that they would easily wipe them out.<br /> <br /> I feel like people keep trying to find a way around the idea they don't believe that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T12:45:12-07:00","id":1460245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460225#post1460225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I dunno, I mean the whole point of the SI is that they're humans showing that if the human race turned its resources against the undead that they would easily wipe them out.<br /> <br /> I feel like people keep trying to find a way around the idea they don't believe that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it's not believable in this universe. The vampires are too strong and too conspiratorial to be vainquished by a bunch of organisations that magically bend together withour being discovered and destroyed a massive magical stronghold and purged whole cities full of elders. Witbout faillures <br /> <br /> That's either 1/ allowed by magical... Caught, enlightened technological guidance<br /> 2/ guidance/control from highly influencials and powerful kindred<br /> 3/stupid deus ex machina and the authors' favorite syndrome.<br /> <br /> Remember that the original inquisition was litterally backed by the sole main organised power of the middle age's europe, with the backing of true faith AND YET they required the guidance of kindred (ladombras and ventrue) and of the mages of the cabal of pure thoughts to exist and target vampires.<br /> <br /> There's never been a purely normal humans action agaisnt kindred in the lore","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T12:50:37-07:00","id":1460247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460225#post1460225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dunno, I mean the whole point of the SI is that they're humans showing that if the human race turned its resources against the undead that they would easily wipe them out.<br /> <br /> I feel like people keep trying to find a way around the idea they don't believe that.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is my feeling as well - to make the SI just more vampire pawns strips them of their utility and appeal. I can see them as something vampires started only to quickly have the SI run amok, but not being under anyone's specific control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T13:07:44-07:00","id":1460251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460247#post1460247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is my feeling as well - to make the SI just more vampire pawns strips them of their utility and appeal. I can see them as something vampires started only to quickly have the SI run amok, but not being under anyone's specific control.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there's room for compromise personally. I mean, vampires betraying their kind to Hunters is to be expected but not EVERY accomplishment of the organization should be the result of vampire or Technocracy manipulation.<br /> <br /> However, I think we all agree that taking down, say, Vienna was silly without some help.<br /> <br /> I could see Vienna or Alamut taken down by a bomb from the air. Not much you can do against that with Thaumaturgy. However, actually INVADING IT? No, that's silly.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T14:09:33-07:00","id":1460254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460251#post1460251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think there's room for compromise personally. I mean, vampires betraying their kind to Hunters is to be expected but not EVERY accomplishment of the organization should be the result of vampire or Technocracy manipulation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed.<br /> <br /> Vampires helping mortals to make an efficient &quot;vampire-killing&quot; organization to deal with Jyhad enemies, and having it backfire?. Wouldn't be the first time.<br /> <br /> Technocracy manipulation?. Thematically, on one hand, as was said it takes protagonism from vampires (and true &quot;badass-normal&quot; humans). Also: 5e doesn't have enough develop on mages to make them a relevant antagonist.<br /> <br /> That being said, a classic WoD &quot;wink&quot; on the style of: &quot;The SI has access to secret technology that works like Artifacts, provided by some misterious organization. Who are they and what do they want? - we're not telling&quot;. Could open some doors for future crossover, w/o closing other posibilities","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T14:17:45-07:00","id":1460255,"title":"","content":"The new SI sourcebook sounds great. Imma defo buy it for when my group switches over to V5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-17T15:13:18-07:00","id":1460259,"title":"","content":"My general view is the Second Inquisition is going to be mostly dangerous to Neonates and Fledglings because they will be going after the places that they hang out at. Ironically, older vampires will become vulnerable because said Neonates are likely to rat out other vampires if they can.<br /> <br /> However, Elders will usually be able to escape because even if you know EXACTLY who an Elder is, they have power and influence to burn so a full-frontal attack even during the day is unlikely to succeed. They HAVE probably killed Elders but not nearly as many as lesser vampires. Maybe 1/10 attacks an Elder will succeed and that is rare by itself. Even then, those successes are probably because someone drew a straight line to their havens and weaknesses for them.<br /> <br /> Methusalehs? No. Not unless someone else is holding the leash or by sheer nightmarish ridiculous luck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-18T01:23:13-07:00","id":1460310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460251#post1460251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I could see Vienna or Alamut taken down by a bomb from the air. Not much you can do against that with Thaumaturgy. However, actually INVADING IT? No, that's silly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends how you bomb it, really, and It's not like the list of thaumaturgy rituals we have is exhaustive. Vienna was bombed 52 times in WWII. I'm sure the Tremere thought of measures. It's very probable that they can cause a bomb to fail to detonate, if not miss, and they've likely built the building so survive a pounding. Heavy artillery may be a better choice, but you can't blame that on terrorists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-18T06:53:16-07:00","id":1460324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460310#post1460310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends how you bomb it, really, and It's not like the list of thaumaturgy rituals we have is exhaustive. Vienna was bombed 52 times in WWII. I'm sure the Tremere thought of measures. It's very probable that they can cause a bomb to fail to detonate, if not miss, and they've likely built the building so survive a pounding. Heavy artillery may be a better choice, but you can't blame that on terrorists.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps WW2 level ordinance, yes.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I basically think the one weakness that should be emphasized is that the Tremere eschew technological development in Paths and that humanity's advancements in weapons will far exceed their ability to counteract it. They might be able to deal with past weapons but not cutting edge.<br /> <br /> Basically, if you're an Ur-Shulgi, &quot;I win&quot; Cainite then you have no place in the game. Everyone should be vulnerable to something.<br /> <br /> Mind you, if someone does get the Austrian air force to drop a bomb on a castle somehow, the least of your issues will be getting the public to believe whatever story it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-18T07:12:18-07:00","id":1460325,"title":"","content":"WW2 ordinance isn't any worse than today's ordinance in terms of power. Accuracy? Sure. Guided missiles and computers and all that, . Power? While they've probably advanced in what the charge is made of, WWII had the advantage in that they had much bigger bombs. I suspect they wouldn't have used the biggest of them to target cities but rather bunkers, but they still used some comically heavy bombs on a regular basis. <br /> <br /> I don't think the Tremere are eschewing technological development paths. There might've been a push against the Tremere that went too far too soon, but it's hard to imagine that's an attitude the Tremere would keep for the decades in which tech has rapidly gotten better. &quot;jam technology&quot; and wards aren't complicated spells, it should be quite easy to combine the two (and to designate exceptions because wards can do that) If the Tremere truly don't trust tech as you say they do, such a ward would be top priority.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-18T07:33:49-07:00","id":1460328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460211-the-second-inquisition-sourcebook-is-now-in-full-development?p=1460325#post1460325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">WW2 ordinance isn't any worse than today's ordinance in terms of power. Accuracy? Sure. Guided missiles and computers and all that, . Power? While they've probably advanced in what the charge is made of, WWII had the advantage in that they had much bigger bombs. I suspect they wouldn't have used the biggest of them to target cities but rather bunkers, but they still used some comically heavy bombs on a regular basis.<br /> <br /> <b>I don't think the Tremere are eschewing technological development paths. </b>There might've been a push against the Tremere that went too far too soon, but it's hard to imagine that's an attitude the Tremere 